# Anti-Checkers is its own repository, published standalone at
# jraleman/anti_checkers and consumed as a game folder by godot-base. Neither
# the superproject's root .gitignore nor godot-base/.gitignore reaches in here
# — a nested repository keeps its own index — so these rules have to be local.
#
# Per the Godot 4.1+ version-control docs, only the engine's generated cache
# belongs in here. Script/resource .uid files and asset .import files are
# project state and are committed on purpose; see README.md.

# Engine cache. The host project owns the real one at godot-base/.godot, but
# opening this folder directly in the editor writes a stray cache beside these
# files, and it must not follow a clone back into godot-base.
.godot/
.import/

# Binary translations compiled from CSV sources.
*.translation

# Export output, should this folder ever be built standalone.
/build/
/exports/
*.apk
*.aab
*.pck

# System / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
